<title>SWEDEN: Volvo says mulling China truck factory.</title>
<headline>Volvo says mulling China truck factory.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo said on Wednesday it would make a decision on whether or not to establish a truck production facility in China in the near future.</p>
</text>
